    "description": "**About The Job**\n**Mercor**\nconnects elite creative and technical talent with leading AI research labs. Headquartered in San Francisco, our investors include\n**Benchmark**\n,\n**General Catalyst**\n,\n**Peter Thiel**\n,\n**Adam D'Angelo**\n,\n**Larry Summers**\n, and\n**Jack Dorsey**\n.\n  \n  \n**Position:**\nCross-Border Financial Services Expert (Brazil ↔ USA)\n  \n  \n**Type:**\n**Contract**\n**Compensation:**\n**$210 total**\n**Location:**\n**Remote**\n**Commitment:**\n**Flexible**\n**Role Responsibilities**\n\n- Evaluate financial products and services based on personal financial experience between Brazil and the United States.\n- Provide insights to improve user experiences in cross-border financial activities.\n- Collaborate with AI teams to enhance model evaluation and market research.\n- Work independently and asynchronously to contribute to project goals.\n- Utilize expertise in premium cross-border banking and financial services.\n\n**Qualifications**\n**Must-Have**\n\n- Experience managing finances across Brazil and the United States.\n- Support family financially across the two countries.\n- Maintain investments or banking relationships across borders.\n- Work in one country while maintaining financial obligations in the other.\n\n**Preferred**\n\n- Reside in Brazil or the United States.\n- 18 years of age or older.\n- High-net-worth or premium banking customer.\n- Familiar with international financial products and services.\n- Experience with Brazilian and U.S. banking services.\n- Use of international money transfer or remittance platforms.\n- Knowledge of foreign exchange services and investment accounts.\n- Experience with international credit cards and U.S. mortgage or real estate financing.\n- Engage with financial advisors or legal professionals specializing in cross-border finance.\n- Use digital wallets or fintech platforms for international financial management.\n\n**Application Process (Takes 20–30 mins to complete)**\n\n- Upload resume\n- AI interview based on your resume\n- Submit form\n\n**Resources & Support**\n\n- For details about the interview process and platform information, please check: https://talent.docs.mercor.com/welcome\n- For any help or support, reach out to: support@mercor.com\n\n*PS: Our team reviews applications daily. Please complete your AI interview and application steps to be considered for this opportunity.*\n#hiringmercor",
